Maus Droid Models

This project includes an integration patch and unmodified Droid driver
reference fixtures derived from OpenMausBot 0.1.110:
https://github.com/milind-soni/OpenMausBot

OpenMausBot is distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Upstream copyrights and attribution remain with their respective owners.

The integration changes are distributed in droid-models.patch. They add
account-authorized model discovery, reasoning-effort variants, credit
multipliers in model labels, and an automatic-model fallback.

fixtures/droid.js and fixtures/index.js are unmodified upstream driver
reference code used to validate patch application. fixtures/droid-acp.mjs
is a simulated CLI for tests.

This independent project is not affiliated with Factory or OpenMausBot.
